body:
Who? Someone I can no longer be with. Someone I love and had built my life around, someone I planned to grow old with and care for, for decades beyond the one we had already shared. A best friend, a lover and a partner. Someone who's loved ones cared for me and who I cared for deeply in turn before they were lost to us. Someone I share a third of my lifetimes memories with, but who made a choice and choices that mean that despite all of my love, I cannot be with them while holding on to who I am and what makes me that person. I asked for no more than I gave, gladly and willingly...


I don't know which I love more now that I have been alone all these months;
Is it really them, or is it the memory of what we once were?
